# Harness-wide Verible waivers (--waiver_files). Normally empty: a waiver is a documented
# false positive, reviewed by the domain owner, never a way to silence a real finding.
#
# Syntax:
#   waive --rule=<rule-name> --line=<n>[:<m>] --location=".*<file-regex>.*"
#   waive --rule=<rule-name> --regex="<line-regex>"
